~ in_room
Impuls: There you are, you devil's crab! Fear me, if anything happens I'll knock on your door!
Crab: Uhhhhh... What, excuse me?
Impuls: Are you deaf?! Get out of here before I stuff you in my pocket and sell you for five bucks to the nearest granny on a bench near the entrance!
Crab: Do you even realize who you're talking to?
Impuls: Yeah, just a giant talking crab with a sharp claw, so what?
Crab: And you're not afraid of me?
Impuls: What's the point? I'll knock you down in no time.
Crab: Oh you...Defend yourself, you hunched over dog!
Impuls: Actually, I'm a rabbit, oh well.
Crab: АААААААААААА!
Impuls: B, also a vitamin.
Crab: How dare you?! Defend yourself!
